model zero_leg
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the round's mutation run (walk/agenda.rs zero_leg, set to true and to false): an instance on a known day whose second leg's amount is a hole is a hole booking; its leg of amount 0 books nothing on any day (L §5.14), so only the hole leg's place is the hole"

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind pairs: event certain
  leg fee: PLN
  leg cash: PLN

place k_fee: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place k_cash: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN question "How much is paid?"
input zero: money PLN
input d1: date

move pay: pairs
  on d1
  leg fee from world to k_fee amount zero
  leg cash from world to k_cash amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  opening[k_fee] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[k_cash] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  zero = 0.00 PLN "s"
  d1 = 2026-03-04 "s"

ask fee_bal: bal(k_fee, 2026-03-31)
ask cash_bal: bal(k_cash, 2026-03-31)
ask fee_flows: flows(pay.fee, 2026-03)
